WEBVTT

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.150
Tomorrow is the final Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.410
It is time to put our plan into action.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.600
Janice...

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.870
You must achieve victory!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:21.580
And then steal the sacred baton from Onee-sama!

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:27.750
When you obtain it, do not return it to Jewlie, but give it to me.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.180
You can accomplish this!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:42.430
You are a chosen individual. So long as you wish, you can reach the peak of idolhood.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.540
You have nothing to fear.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.610
You know what I say to be true.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.700
"To be true"...

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.000
Let's eat!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.750
Pork cutlet
bowl

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:36.010
NonSugar's gonna feast on victory today, you hear me.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.960
Pork cutlet curry

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.470
Like I'm gonna let my little sister beat me!

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:40.680
I can't lose to my two daughters!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.970
Pork cutlet pizza

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:43.140
I can't lose to my two daughters!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.940
I think everyone should give italiano they've got...

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:50.360
It'd be très bien if <i>everyone</i> could win!

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.650
Quit dreaming!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.320
Okay-mozzarella...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.070
A fight between women is sc-erian pork stuff!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.210
The final Grand Prix!

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.610
Apparently there's heaps of contestants!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.420
I can't predict who's going to win!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:12.380
Isn't it thrilling?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.110
Of course it's going to be Dressing Pafé!

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:18.780
It'll be SoLaMi SMILE!

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.470
Pri!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.650
It's Garmageddon!

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:27.850
Whoosh, whoosh!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.180
team photosynthesis
Whoosh, whoosh!

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.080
Dosukoi! We'll leave them stunned-chanko!

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:33.730
Sophie Alliance A!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.610
We're destined for success-alvador Dalí!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.060
Behold the abilities of us veterans!

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.740
Q.P.Cosmix!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.410
We were veterans before you were born,
and we're not going down easily!

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:46.460
Madame Cleaner!

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.460
Tension relax!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.420
Mum! Onee-chan!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.590
Non?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.160
Have you seen Chiri?

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.220
Huh?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.120
Not around here, no.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.850
She's not here yet?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.560
You don't reckon she's scared of facing me?

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.450
Bleah!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.140
I'm gonna go get her.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.440
Me too!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.880
She's going to Chiri's house-pri?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.650
Make sure you're back before you go on stage!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.460
Will they be okay?

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.870
Ucha...

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:33.000
Hello. Is Chiri home?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:39.500
Chiri! Pull yourself together, I say! The Grand Prix's nearly begun!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.960
I can't possibly do it...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.130
Get to PriPara – there's no time to waste!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.390
At this rate, my plans will amount to naught!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.810
Leave now, Chiri. That's an order.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.670
An order?

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.520
What's this about a plan?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.940
Non! Pepper!

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:06.230
Merry Christmas!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.120
And here's our present for you all!

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.080
Presenting the Fourth Divine Idol Grand Prix: the Divine Tops Competition!

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:21.400
It's starting, Maho-chan!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:22.920
I'm so glad we made it.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:26.490
But you really don't want to enter?

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.200
I'm all finished up with Miss Cow's birthing.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.010
And I'm not really exhausted.

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:33.400
It's fine.

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:38.930
What need do we have to participate when we've already earned our right to compete in the final?

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.480
We have other objectives for the present.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.370
So in light of their circumstances,

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.410
we can put NonSugar last.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:55.190
I hope they can make it now-ucha.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.750
No, I can't be lost in though-ucha!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.840
I have to monitor our opposing teams-ucha!

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.750
And this makes the final Grand Prix!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.980
I'm thrilled to see so many participants this time.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:10.780
I'm sure the goddess Jewlie is overjoyed as well.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.780
Will we see a team today free the Divine Tops,

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:18.680
last remaining piece of the Divine Coord?

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:19.270
Without further ado:

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.180
in style,

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.580
here we go!

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.990
Our first entrant:

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.900
Their power is without peer when bathed in sunlight!

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.140
Their flowers open for you!

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.960
Team Photosynthesis!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.120
Hey, here comes Team Sideshow!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.220
No, stop, Non!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.260
Ooh-ooh!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.340
What's going on? What's this "plan"?

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.230
Good to eat?

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.180
I can't tell you...

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:05.150
Janice will be cross with me.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.700
The Grand Prix's about to start, you know.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.690
Hurry or get eaten!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.330
She what? She told you to swipe Jewlie's baton?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.120
Ooh-ooh!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.000
Baton good to eat? Then me take it!

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.670
Now spill the beans.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.540
The baton belongs to Jululu...

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.150
No, to Jewlie!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.680
Why would you try to do that?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.940
Chiri – you blabbed?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.650
That called having sticky fingers, you know.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.820
Her fingers are sticky? But why?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.630
I like it

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:49.990
From touching poop!
I like it

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:55.530
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.840
Touching... that sacred baton...!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.740
Sticky fingers! Sticky fingers!

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:06.460
Poop fingers! Sticky fingers!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.300
You do not understand anything!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.490
Onee-chan has transgressed against the Goddess System –

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:16.390
that is to say, against the
Divine Idol Grand Prix system itself!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.230
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.360
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.490
Starting the Coord Change.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.850
The vivid colours and deep black make a lovely contrast.

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.340
It's the LoveDevi Coord!

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:41.270
And the card suit marks dotting the arrangement draw the eye!

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.160
Garmageddon Coord!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.460
Devi!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:44.870
Geru!

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.620
Garu!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.880
Chiri! Return this instant! Chiri!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:54.050
Chiri, do you really agree with what Janice is saying?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.120
I don't know...

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.730
What she's saying makes sense...

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.520
About how breaking the rules isn't allowed...

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.540
In Sapanna, always say. Breaking rules is bad.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.790
Pepper, quit butting in.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.650
And if I do as Janice says,

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.280
she'll make me a proper idol...

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.490
Well, <i>I</i> believe that Jululu...

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.290
that Jewlie is right!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.920
And stealing is bad, too!

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.970
Yes, I do think that.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:39.930
I don't like the idea of snatching a goddess's baton either.

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:43.720
What do <i>you</i> want to do, Chiri?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.900
I don't know...

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:46.900
Can't say "don't know"! Ooh-ooh!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.160
I... I...

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.090
If I can...

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:53.420
No.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.500
I really want to say no.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.620
I think there needs to be a better way.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.260
Then you can just tell her no.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:04.080
Eh?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.620
Let's scarper! Go to performance!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.400
Prize is waiting!

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:13.220
We can't. I don't want to go perform with these feelings.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:14.670
That would just be...

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.300
no good!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:20.140
Everyone else is putting all of themselves into it!

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:37.140
All of themselves?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.860
Me like PriPara rules!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.160
Making Drama, switch on!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.370
You can do it...

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:48.870
Devi!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.960
If you try!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.760
Gerun!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:57.840
Gajira...
Gerun!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:58.860
Gajira...

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:00.410
Gajira!

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:04.510
Miraculous monster à la mode!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:08.080
Super Cyalume Change!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:13.800
Gerun!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.480
Garu!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.110
Devi-devi!

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.730
I can't do this after all!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.440
Janice will be cross with me...

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.400
You have to tell her.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:02.360
I've never gone against Janice's will before.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.200
Rule of Sapanna: if yes, say "yes"! If no, say "no"!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.130
If no, say "no"...

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.810
Um... so...

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.480
What is it?

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.900
I remembered something I have to do!

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.370
I can't do this...

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.780
You can do it, Chiri!

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:58.170
Have courage, Chiri! Protect rules!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.010
Courage...

00:13:03.040 --> 00:13:04.810
O... Okay.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.650
What has you scampering about, Chiri?

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.860
What is your task?

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.380
Answer me.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.040
To...

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.710
steal the baton.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.040
Keep it up, Chiri!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.110
Eat meat, will be fine!

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.060
Have courage, Chiri!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.380
I know you can do it, Chiri!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.350
I can...?

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.220
Yeah!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:39.190
Making Drama, switch on!

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.360
Beyond the stars!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:43.860
Rock and roll!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.250
Tension max!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.530
Relax!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:50.010
Lunar advent!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:52.660
Rockin' Moon Landing!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.560
One small step, one giant leap!

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.540
<i>Go</i>!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.620
Super Cyalume Change!

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:06.260
<i>Go</i>!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.300
It's Christmax!

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:39.690
You're rather vexing! If you have something to say, say it!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:45.460
Um...

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.560
If you insist on keeping me waiting,

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:50.620
I will become incapable of leading you further.

00:15:50.620 --> 00:15:51.930
We'll bid each other adieu.

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:58.310
Your lineage has blessed you from a young age with a high-class education,

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.270
and I had thought you a most worthy idol.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:06.270
And as I spent time with you,

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:08.280
I thought that surely

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:11.990
you could seize victory at the Grand Prix. And I expended much effort on you.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.570
Come on, Chiri!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:19.660
Chiri! Chiri!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.260
Come on, Chiri!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.370
Ate meat! Will be fine!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.670
Here we go, here we go!

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.060
Whee, whee!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.260
I...

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.810
You must go to the Grand Prix quickly!

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:36.970
How long do you intend to sit dawdling?

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.180
Um...

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.780
Chiri.

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.640
You've been most amenable thus far.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.260
You've inherited much talent through tradition.

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:50.170
And you've a wealth of natural ability as well.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:54.450
And above all, you're an honest and obedient girl.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:57.500
That is your greatest talent.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.380
That is why I've had such great expectations for you.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:30.020
Chiri! Chiri! Chiri!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.830
We're here with you!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.790
No matter what it takes!

00:17:54.860 --> 00:18:00.430
I won't do it.

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:02.890
Chiri...

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:07.370
Non! Pepper! I said it!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.020
I said it loudly and clearly

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.890
Way to go, Chiri! Way to go!

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.650
Chiri's cheeks, salty!

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.150
Tasty!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.920
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:41.430
Yay!

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.650
O holy night,

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:58.110
Christmas Sweets Park!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.990
Super Cyalume Change!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.910
Merry Pristmas!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:42.740
You've betrayed me, Chiri?

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.500
We're almost out of time! Let's go!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.040
Okay!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:45.740
Ooh-ooh!
Okay!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:47.740
Run!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:50.500
Curse you, Chiri...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.790
How could you!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.250
Yes!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.600
I shall not give in!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.560
Goddess power!

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.980
Oh!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.530
I knew I had it in me!

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:20.740
You won't escape me now!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.700
Onward!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.020
Come on!

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:27.890
Yeah!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.260
Mum, have you seen Non?

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.260
No, I haven't seen her.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.720
No way! The next performance is the last one.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:46.800
Ucha...

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.520
Kuma.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:48.180
Usa.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.890
Well, then, I suppose that means NonSugar is absenting.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.260
No, wait.

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:57.240
Please, can't you wait just a little longer?

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.420
It's the system, you see.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.320
Please, I'm begging you.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.860
Please-ucha!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:06.130
Miss Meganee, there are still
four teams that haven't competed.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.310
Eh?

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:09.960
I'm sure NonSugar is meant to be next, though...

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:13.150
Miss Meganee, you've gone one page too far.

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.450
Oh my, you're right.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:18.020
Ucha?

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.760
Thank you, Miss Meganee.

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:21.050
Not at all, Miss Meganee.

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.050
What does that mean?

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:28.010
It means there are still four teams left
before NonSugar needs to go on.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.980
It's the system!

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:34.800
Thank goodness-ucha!

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:36.480
Don't cry, Usacha.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.900
But you can cry in Onii-chan here's chest-kuma.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:40.940
Who're you callin' Onii-chan?!

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:41.660
Right y'are...

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:42.610
Usa!

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.230
Prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:21:47.820 --> 00:21:48.890
Non!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.080
Ucha!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.880
Thank goodness-ucha!

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:54.500
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:56.500
If cry, you become tasty with salt flavour!

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.700
Isn't that great, Usacha?

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.220
Hey! I was going to say that-ucha!
Hey! I was going to say that-kuma!

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:06.470
Ahem, ahem.

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:09.340
You're in the way; please prostrate yourselves and capisce.

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:11.810
We're gonna win this thing.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.100
Let's go, NonSugar!

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.470
Verily.

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:54.160
All three of you made it-ucha!

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.370
Sorry to keep you waiting, Usacha!

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:58.200
But now we're back, it's time to soar head and bring in the win!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.290
Naïve-ucha!

00:23:59.290 --> 00:24:00.340
Huh?

00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:04.410
This is the <i>final</i> Grand Prix;
all the teams are bringing their A-game-ucha!

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:06.520
NonSugar's going to lose at this rate!

00:24:06.520 --> 00:24:08.720
No way! Then what should we do?

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:10.100
By levelling up-ucha!

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:12.460
We'll create a new Making Drama-ucha!

00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:14.100
Wait – right now?!

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:16.960
Next time, <i>The Grand Prix is Not So Sweet-ucha</i>!

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:19.930
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
